<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 68.6385 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 68.6385 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 68.6385 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.5189 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 5		   Sep 4</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.6385		 68.5189</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  5.465		  18.865</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
